# Test artifacts (defense-in-depth: tests/ may generate sensitive runtime files)
# Matches any tests/ directory at any depth: apps/*/tests/, packages/*/tests/, etc.
**/tests/.env*
**/tests/**/credentials*.json
**/tests/**/secrets*.json
**/tests/**/account_state.json
**/tests/**/positions.json
**/tests/**/trade_log.json
**/tests/**/trade_history.json
**/tests/**/test_output*.jsonl

# Handoff docs
.handoff/

# Run artifacts
*_out.txt
